6712 * dhaḍa 'trunk of body'. Pk. dhaḍa - n. 'trunk of body', S. dhaṛu m., P. dhaṛ f.;
Ku. dhaṛ m. 'trunk of body or tree, middle part of anything';
B. dhaṛ 'trunk of body', Or. dhaṛa 'trunk of body
or tree'; Mth. dhar 'headless body'; OAw. dhara m.
'body, heart'; H. dhaṛ m. 'trunk of body' (→ Mth. N. dhaṛ ), OMarw. dhaṛa m., G. dhaṛ n.; M. dhaḍ n. 'headless body'. — L. dhaṛ f., dhaṛā m. 'heap, party'?? * dhaḍāṅgaka -.
